# Kairos — HTTPS for the backend API (deployment only). Auto-TLS via Let's Encrypt.
# The frontend is hosted on Vercel and calls https://DOMAIN directly, so the API allows the
# Vercel origin through CORS_ORIGINS. Requires KAIROS_DOMAIN in .env, DNS A record → the EC2 IP,
# and ports 80 and 443 open. Used by the `kairos-caddy` service (profile prod). See docs/DEPLOY.md.
# No `encode` block: compression can buffer the Copilot answer stream (text/event-stream).
{$KAIROS_DOMAIN} {
	reverse_proxy kairos-backend-api:8000
}
